 "integ7_fix": "No __aug entry in the window. THE BREAKAGE THIS PREVENTS: the window binder ran __aug on the pre-launch primal copies before __tl/__ad; __aug repeats the forward in place (totuflux/totdflux/totuclfl/totdclfl := fluxfac * input), so __tl/__ad, which recompute u1 = fluxfac*u0 from those words, used F and N = heatfac*(F[l]-F[l+1]) fluxfac (62831.85) times too large; the -N*ddp/dp^2 term of dhtr was 62832x (fit rel 9e-7 at all 6 launches of steps 1-4, integ7 diag d4), the radiation-live tangent grew 1e4-1e5 per step and overflowed at step 9. TL and AD were consistent (dots pass) but both wrong against FD."
